sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant L as layout
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    P->>UI: click Load track...
    UI-->>P: file dialog
    P->>UI: choose green_line.json
    UI->>S: inspectTrackConfig(url)
    S->>L: load_layout_file(path)
    alt not a layout, or a wayside database
        L-->>S: LayoutError(reason)
        S-->>UI: {ok: false, error}
        UI-->>P: reason shown, nothing changes
    else a valid layout
        L-->>S: ParsedLayout
        S-->>UI: line, blocks, switches, crossings, waysides (fixed), replaces
        UI-->>P: confirmation, with the fixed wayside count
        P->>UI: click Load
        UI->>S: loadTrackConfig(url)
        S->>L: build_line(parsed)
        Note right of L: The number of waysides is fixed by the track (WAYSIDE_COUNTS), never chosen.
        L-->>S: LineLayout (blocks divided among the waysides)
        S->>M: load_track(line)
        M->>M: drop the line of the same name, with its programs
        loop each wayside of the line
            M->>W: create (territory, no program)
            W->>W: generate and compile the vital code
        end
        M-->>S: ids of the replaced waysides
        S->>S: select the line and its first wayside, empty buffer
        S-->>UI: selection, buffer, controller changed
        UI-->>P: line and waysides listed, NOT READY
    end
